Z||000000||DXR_DAD||05-06-2000||04:49 PM||||Ok this is funny. I have a stock raido, 200watt amp & EQ, It sounds great, new speakes all 4 It's been installed for about a year now with no problems. It started picking up cell phone signals????. Before my cell rings I hear a loud CLICK CLICK CLICK and Buss like sound. Some times when I'm at a stop light it will buss, but it's not my phone??? somebodys on a cell phone close by.<P>I NEED TO FIND OUT WHY, AND HOW TO FIX<P>THANKS ||||reg||5
